ad\", \"Best experience ever\"]\n","test_seq = pad_sequences(tokenizer.texts_to_sequences(test_texts), maxlen=padded.shape[1], padding='post')\n","\n","predictions = model_m2o.predict(test_seq)\n","for text, pred in zip(test_texts, predictions):\n","    print(f\"{text:30s} → Score: {pred[0]:.4f} → {'Positive' if pred[0] > 0.5 else 'Negative'}\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"PSrwRad6ve7a","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787036513209,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":154,"user":{"displayName":"Datamites 20","userId":"14310035420113588722"}},"outputId":"10be7fa1-4c77-490d-9406-7fe45ecbb428"},"execution_count":14,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\u001b[1m1/1\u001b[0m \u001b[32m━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[0m \u001b[1m0s\u001b[0m 54ms/step\n","The movie was neither good nor bad → Score: 0.5306 → Positive\n","Best experience ever           → Score: 0.5548 → Positive\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**What just happened step by step:**\n","\n","| Step | What | Detail |\n","|------|------|--------|\n","| 1. Tokenizer | Words → Numbers | \"I love this movie\" → [2, 3, 4, 1] |\n","| 2. Padding | Same length | [2, 3, 4, 1, 0, 0] (zeros added) |\n","| 3. Embedding | Numbers → Vectors | Each word becomes an 8-dim vector |\n","| 4. SimpleRNN | Process sequence | Reads word by word, builds memory |\n","| 5. Dense(sigmoid) | Final prediction | Single number between 0-1 |\n","\n","**Key difference from One-to-One:**\n","- One-to-One: `[3 features] → Dense → output` (no sequence)\n","- Many-to-One: `[sequence of words] → Embedding → RNN → Dense → output` (order matters!)"],"metadata":{"id":"R35N4eiRvoi0"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["---\n","\n","## Type 2: One-to-Many\n","\n","**What:** Single input → Sequence of outputs\n","\n","**Real-world examples:**\n","\n","| Application | Input (one) | Output (many) |\n","|-------------|-------------|---------------|\n","| Image Captioning | 1 image | \"A dog playing in the park\" |\n","| Music Generation | 1 genre/mood | Sequence of musical notes |\n","| Story Generation | 1 prompt word | Full paragraph |\n","\n","**How it works:**\n","```\n","Image Captioning Example:\n","\n","Input: [Photo of dog in park]\n","            ↓\n","Step 1: → generates \"A\"\n","Step 2: → generates \"dog\"\n","Step 3: → generates \"playing\"\n","Step 4: → generates \"in\"\n","Step 5: → generates \"the\"\n","Step 6: → generates \"park\"\n","Step 7: → generates <END>\n","```\n","\n","**Key setting:** `return_sequences=True` — model outputs at every time step"],"metadata":{"id":"EUcsiOUmzmq2"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### Demo 2: One-to-Many (Text Generation)\n","\n","**Task:** Give 1 character → model generates a sequence of characters\n","\n","```\n","Input: 'h'  →  Output: 'h' → 'e' → 'l' → 'l' → 'o' → ...\n","```"],"metadata":{"id":"CRb9gYdgvrdP"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# One-to-Many: character-level text generation\n","text = \"hello world\"\n","chars = sorted(set(text))\n","char_to_idx = {c: i for i, c in enumerate(chars)}\n","idx_to_char = {i: c for c, i in char_to_idx.items()}\n","\n","# Given 1 char → predict next char\n","X_o2m = np.array([[char_to_idx[text[i]]] for i in range(len(text)-1)])\n","y_o2m = np.array([[char_to_idx[text[i+1]]] for i in range(len(text)-1)])\n","\n","model_gen = Sequential([\n","    Embedding(input_dim=len(chars), output_dim=8, input_length=1),\n","    SimpleRNN(32, return_sequences=True),\n","    TimeDistributed(Dense(len(chars), activation='softmax'))\n","])\n","model_gen.compile(optimizer='adam', loss='sparse_categorical_crossentropy')\n","model_gen.fit(X_o2m, y_o2m, epochs=100, verbose=1)"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"AdsoEPHCvt8f","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787039702412,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":8535,"user":{"displayName":"Datamites 20","userId":"14310035420113588722"}},"outputId":"a6eb2e72-4dce-4e58-9201-a48989d67