"---\n","\n","## Type 4: Many-to-Many\n","\n","**What:** Sequence of inputs → Sequence of outputs\n","\n","**Two sub-types:**\n","\n","### 4a. Same-length (input length = output length)\n","\n","| Application | Input | Output |\n","|-------------|-------|--------|\n","| POS Tagging | [\"I\", \"love\", \"NLP\"] | [Pronoun, Verb, Noun] |\n","| NER | [\"Elon\", \"works\", \"at\", \"Tesla\"] | [Person, O, O, Company] |\n","| Video Classification | [frame1, frame2, frame3] | [action1, action2, action3] |\n","\n","```\n","POS Tagging Example:\n","\n","Input:   \"I\"       \"love\"     \"NLP\"\n","          ↓          ↓          ↓\n","         [h1]  →   [h2]  →   [h3]\n","          ↓          ↓          ↓\n","Output: Pronoun     Verb      Noun\n","```\n","\n","### 4b. Different-length (Encoder-Decoder)\n","\n","| Application | Input | Output |\n","|-------------|-------|--------|\n","| Translation | \"I love NLP\" (English, 3 words) | \"मुझे NLP पसंद है\" (Hindi, 4 words) |\n","| Summarization | Long paragraph | Short summary |\n","| Chatbot | User question | Bot answer |\n","\n","```\n","Translation Example:\n","\n","ENCODER:  \"I\" → \"love\" → \"NLP\" → [context vector]\n","                                        ↓\n","DECODER:                         \"मुझे\" → \"NLP\" → \"पसंद\" → \"है\"\n","```\n","\n","**Key setting:** `return_sequences=True` — output at **every** time step"],"metadata":{"id":"WG5mACS1zr7h"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### Demo 3: Many-to-Many (POS Tagging)\n","\n","**Task:** Each word gets its own tag\n","\n","```\n","Input:   [\"I\",      \"love\",   \"good\",  \"food\"]\n","Output:  [Pronoun,  Verb,     Adjective, Noun]\n","```\n","\n","Key: `return_sequences=True` → output at every time step"],"metadata":{"id":"yiT5B0m9vxCN"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# Many-to-Many: simple POS tagger\n","sentences = [\n","    [\"I\", \"love\", \"deep\", \"learning\"],\n","    [\"he\", \"hates\", \"bad\", \"movies\"],\n","    [\"she\", \"likes\", \"good\", \"food\"],\n","]\n","tags = [[0, 1, 3, 2], [0, 1, 3, 2], [0, 1, 3, 2]]\n","# 0=Pronoun, 1=Verb, 2=Noun, 3=Adjective\n","\n","all_words = sorted(set(w for s in sentences for w in s))\n","word2idx = {w: i+1 for i, w in enumerate(all_words)}\n","\n","X_m2m = np.array([[word2idx[w] for w in s] for s in sentences])\n","y_m2m = np.array(tags).reshape(3, 4, 1)\n","\n","model_tag = Sequential([\n","    Embedding(input_dim=len(word2idx)+1, output_dim=8, input_length=4),\n","    SimpleRNN(16, return_sequences=True),\n","    TimeDistributed(Dense(5, activation='softmax'))\n","])\n","model_tag.compile(optimizer='adam', loss='sparse_categorical_crossentropy')\n","model_tag.fit(X_m2m, y_m2m, epochs=100, verbose=0)"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"Op384rwxv8VZ","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787040712167,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":6366,"user":{"displayName":"Datamites 20","userId":"14310035420113588722"}},"outputId":"a38a4ed3-c414-483b-bf52-6fcf826eb105"},"execution_count":19,"outputs":[{"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":["<keras.src.callbacks.history.History at 0x782358176ed0>"]},"metadata":{},"execution_count":19}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# Test\n","tag_names = {0: \"Pronoun\", 1: \"Verb\", 2: \"Noun\", 3: \"Adjective\"}\n","test_sent = [\"I\", \"love\", \"good\", \"food\"]\n","test_input = np.array([[word2idx.get(w, 0) for w in test_sent]])\n","pred_tags = model_tag.predict(test_input, verbose=0)\n","\n","print(\"Input: \", test_sent)\n","print(\"Output:\", [tag_names[np.argmax(p)] for p in pred_tags[0]])\n","print(f\"\\n→ 4 words in → 4 tags out (one tag per word)\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"9KEQ5OcYxlzS","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1787040718477,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":403,"user":{"displayName":"Datamites 20","userId":"14310035420113588722"}},"outputId":"d7ee1781-f966-4d8d-b9d3-51449b7b2709"},"execution_count":20,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Input:  ['I', 'love', 'good', 'food']\n","Output: ['Pronoun', 'Verb', 'Adjective', 'Noun']\n","\n","→ 4 words in → 4 tags out (one tag per word)\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":[],"metadata":{"id":"g_Poe2GGjs8G"}}]}